CRITICAL: If the user requests subtle or non-punchy colors, use sophisticated, muted hex codes. If they request corporate colors, use professional, balanced colors. You MUST adapt the colors perfectly to the user vibe request.
CRITICAL: DO NOT always use "bordered" layout or green shades. Vary the "layout_style" randomly between "minimal", "floating", and "bordered". If the vibe is modern/techy, strongly prefer "minimal" or "floating". DO NOT default to green unless requested!

SOURCE CONTENT SNIPPET:
{file_content[:3000]}

OUTPUT FORMAT: Return STRICT JSON ONLY.
{{
  "theme": {{
    "primary": "#HEX",
    "primary_l": "#HEX",
    "secondary": "#HEX",
